OL,3,GNEWSAChances to protect teen killed by
OL,4,Aher dad 'missed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review of how organisations supported
OL,7,Fa teenager before she was murdered by
OL,8,Fher father said there was "a need to
OL,9,Frecognise children as victims of
OL,10,Fdomestic abuse".
OL,12,FThe domestic homicide review looked
OL,13,Finto the case of Lauren Malt, 19, from
OL,14,FWest Winch, Norfolk, who died in
OL,15,FJanuary 2022 after Nigel Malt
OL,16,Frepeatedly drove his car over her.
OL,18,FIt concluded there had been
OL,19,F"insufficient understanding of the risk
OL,20,F[Nigel Malt] posed" and "the degree of
OL,21,Fcontrol he held over all family
OL,22,Fmembers".
